{"summary":"Fly Willow the Whale through the magical skies of Rainbow Land!","description":"Fly Willow the Whale through the magical skies of Rainbow Land!\n\nCollect Blubbles, loop the loop, smash grumpy Thunder Bros and meet friends along the way.\n\nChoose how you want to play: sit back and explore endless Classic Mode or unlock stars in bite-size Challenge Levels.\n\nFeatures\n• Soundtrack by Gruff Rhys of ‘The Super Furry Animals’ \n• Simple and intuitive one touch gameplay \n• 2 game modes, Classic and Challenge \n• 2 Challenge Packs with 64 levels, can you 3 STAR them all? \n• Go wild smashing the Thunder Bros in 'Frenzy' mode \n• Launch into space at super speed with Hyper-Boost power-ups \n• Smash clouds with Cloud Mine power-up \n• Suck up Blubbles with Blubble Magnet power-up \n• Compete against friends with Scoreloop \n• 64 achievements to unlock, testing your skills to the MAX\n\nHow to play\n• Press and hold anywhere on the screen to make Willow swoop upwards\n• Release your finger from the screen to make Willow dive downwards\n• Press and hold to make Willow perform a loop the loop, useful when collecting hard to reach Blubbles","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":null,"video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/IPnUJlwChGY?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/GGL0acXCl0ELQjnLoUoe3ePfnxJQb_YEbW74EQ1qbslGDoIHWpHn2cR3ndM8LpJBzj7wc-DN6Aap2mIO7d9JLeE","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/gVqmEtV7Gmb10krlO0d26RztKkrnnI9YLFLmHVbD0qpMyjBTnrXDnGV8_EwVwLvYTRFMH0mlj4pKR56FUiB5","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/pu52zM0kwfgm74443f7wT7kv01BVr3Lgq2ISruw7HGdtBdz-NEQMIcR3QlnxdB1Y-aFO-mIKctnWbqOAxlq0qg","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/rLYru0mL5XCehn1q4YMrVtOIhALVWkDmCpAc_opPyCb5O8MsOsffHU3HjaaCs-GM4rA4YJIohiNrdGzRu0unLA","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/u-qC-YL-5tx4Rd3m23IT0EWNkIxpWI_CpSq1jNXXVDNAaodRZI0dkI0kOII5_Z09RFl6AtrRMvs3FREAhvzs","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IDt